OL,3,ALeasehold system set to be scrapped in
OL,4,AEngland and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Residential Freehold
OL,7,FAssociation says the plan is an
OL,8,F"unprecedented abuse" of their rights,
OL,9,Fwhich will wipe billions from the value
OL,10,Fof pension funds, which have invested
OL,11,Fheavily in property.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
