OL,3,A'I have to be up for work soon...':
OL,4,AGamers stay up for GTA 6 after midnight
OL,5,Arelease
OL,6,
OL,7,FGTA 6, in which players explore a
OL,8,Ffictional US state called Leonida,
OL,9,Ffeatures the series' first playable
OL,10,Ffemale protagonist in a 3D setting
OL,12,FAnd the reviews are very positive -
OL,13,F"Great graphics and gameplay so far,"
OL,14,Fone gamer in Newport says
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
