OL,3,ATop UN court begins judgment on whether
OL,4,AMyanmar committed genocide against
OL,5,ARohingya
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe International Court of Justice
OL,8,F(ICJ) is delivering what is expected to
OL,9,Fbe a landmark judgment on Myanmar,
OL,10,Fwhich is accused of committing genocide
OL,11,Fagainst its Rohingya minority
OL,13,FA military crackdown in 2017 killed
OL,14,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more
OL,15,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority
OL,16,FMyanmar for neighbouring Bangladesh
OL,18,FMyanmar denies genocide in the case
OL,19,Fbrought by The Gambia and says its
OL,20,Fforces were responding to attacks by
OL,21,Farmed groups
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
